<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - Sweden to auction two bln SKR 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sweden to auction two bln SKR 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Debt Office on Wednesday invited bids for two billion crowns worth of 10-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 1030 GMT on August 27.</p>
<p>						  Bond 1037</p>
<p> Maturity date				August 15, 2007</p>
<p> Coupon (pct)				 8.0</p>
<p> Volume to market (Billions Skr)	2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			    September 1</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
